# Screen console pictures (make test): text, then a scrolled screen, then atari / F12.
# INIT starts the shell with the browser: Esc leaves it
1500 {esc}
+1500 hello The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog: 0123456789 []()<>?!@#$%^&*_+-=|~`'";:,./\\\n
+5000 dir\n
+2000 ps\n
+2000 hllo{left}{left}{left}e
# shot 1 at 13.5 s
+3000 \n
+500 cat long.txt\n
# shot 2 at 20 s
# the pointer: move it over the text (hardware pointer, drawn by Marga)
+2000 M 100:-80:0:0
+300 M 60:-40:0:0
+2700 atari\n
# shot 3 at 22 s (classic machine: the desktop is off)
+2000 {F12}
+1000 mem\n
# shot 4 at 26.5 s
